{"ch": 113, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "قُلۡ اَعُوۡذُ بِرَبِّ الۡفَلَقِ ۙ﴿۲﴾", "en": "[✲]Say, ‘I seek refuge in the Lord of the dawn,", "w": ["say", "I seek refuge", "in the Lord of", "the dawn", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "مِنۡ شَرِّ مَا خَلَقَ ۙ﴿۳﴾", "en": "‘From the evil of that which He has created,", "w": ["from", "the evil of", "which", "He has created", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "وَمِنۡ شَرِّ غَاسِقٍ اِذَا وَقَبَ ۙ﴿۴﴾", "en": "‘And from the evil of the night when it overspreads,", "w": ["and from", "the evil of", "the night", "when", "it overspreads", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "وَمِنۡ شَرِّ النَّفّٰثٰتِ فِی الۡعُقَدِ ۙ﴿۵﴾", "en": "‘And from the evil of those who blow into knots <i>to undo them</i>,", "w": ["and from", "the evil of", "those who blow", "into", "knots <i>to undo them</i>", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "وَمِنۡ شَرِّ حَاسِدٍ اِذَا حَسَدَ ﴿٪۶﴾", "en": "‘And from the evil of the envier when he envies.’", "w": ["and from", "the evil", "of the envier", "when", "he envies", ""]}]}